          {
            "title": "Adding strings",
            "id": 78795,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita telah mempelajari bahwa kita bisa menggunakan <code>+</code> untuk menambahkan dua string dan menampilkannya secara bersamaan.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;new&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot; messages&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"new messages\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>+</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita telah mempelajari bahwa kita bisa menggunakan <code>+</code> untuk menambahkan dua string dan menampilkannya secara bersamaan.</p><p>Gabungkan kedua string agar console menampilkan <code>new messages</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;new&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot; messages&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\",\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"new messages\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>+</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Adding numbers and strings",
            "id": 78796,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Namun, menggunakan <code>+</code> untuk menggabungkan data numerik seperti <code>2</code> dan <code>\" new messages\"</code> akan menghasilkan <strong>error</strong> karena keduanya merupakan jenis nilai yang berbeda.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot; new messages&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"9\" /><option startIndex=\"10\" endIndex=\"25\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Traceback (most recent call last):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  File &quot;/home/default/code/file.py&quot;, line 1, in &lt;module&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    print(2 + &quot; new messages&quot;)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"TypeError: unsupported operand type(s) for +: 'int' and 'str'\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>+</code>, diikuti oleh <code>\" new messages\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Menggabungkan data numerik dan data string dengan <code>+</code> menghasilkan <strong>error</strong> karena keduanya merupakan jenis nilai yang berbeda.</p><p>Letakkan angka <code>2</code> di kiri dan teks <code> new messages</code> di kanan untuk menghasilkan error tersebut.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot; new messages&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"7\" /><option startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"9\" /><option startIndex=\"10\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;2&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"*\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Traceback (most recent call last):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  File &quot;/home/default/code/file.py&quot;, line 1, in &lt;module&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    print(2 + &quot; new messages&quot;)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"TypeError: unsupported operand type(s) for +: 'int' and 'str'\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>2</code>, diikuti oleh <code>+</code>, dan terakhir <code>\" new messages\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Formatted strings",
            "id": 78797,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>f-string, singkatan dari formatted strings, memungkinkan kita menampilkan ekspresi seperti menambahkan string ke angka tanpa menghasilkan error.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;\" /><text value=\"{\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text value=\" new messages&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"25\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"2 new messages\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>f\"{2} new messages\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>f-string, singkatan dari formatted string, memungkinkanmu menampilkan angka dan teks bersama-sama.</p><p>Mulai dengan <code>f</code> sebelum tanda kutip. Letakkan angka dalam kurung kurawal, seperti <code>{2}</code>.</p><p>Lengkapi baris dengan f-string agar konsol menampilkan <code>2 new messages</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;\" /><text value=\"{\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text value=\" new messages&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;{2} new messages&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"f&quot;{2 new messages}&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"2 new messages\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>f\"{2} new messages\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Formatted strings",
            "id": 78798,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Setiap pernyataan f-string terdiri dari dua bagian, pertama karakter <code>f</code>, lalu string yang ingin kita format.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;\" /><text value=\"{\" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text value=\" new messages&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"7\" /><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"25\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"6 new messages\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>f</code>, diikuti oleh <code>\"{6} new messages\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Setiap pernyataan f-string terdiri dari dua bagian, pertama karakter <code>f</code>, lalu string yang ingin kita format.</p><p>Buat f-string dengan angka di dalam kurung kurawal agar konsol menampilkan <code>6 new messages</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;\" /><text value=\"{\" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text value=\" new messages&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"7\" /><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;6 new messages&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"6 new messages\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>f</code>, diikuti oleh <code>\"{6} new messages\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Formatted strings",
            "id": 78799,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Selanjutnya, tambahkan berbagai jenis nilai di dalam kurung kurawal agar ditampilkan sebagai satu pernyataan print. Seperti di sini, dengan <code>{2}</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;\" /><text value=\"{\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text value=\" new messages&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"11\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"2 new messages\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>{2}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Formatted strings",
            "id": 78800,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Menempatkan variabel seperti <code>new_messages</code> di antara kurung kurawal juga menampilkan nilainya.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"new_messages = \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;\" /><text value=\"{new_messages}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\" new messages&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"38\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"2 new messages\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>new_messages</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Menempatkan variabel seperti <code>new_messages</code> di antara kurung kurawal juga menampilkan nilainya.</p><p>Masukkan variabel ke dalam kurung kurawal agar console menampilkan <code>2 new messages</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"new_messages = \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;\" /><text value=\"{new_messages}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\" new messages&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"38\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;new_messages&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"2 new messages\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>new_messages</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Expressions",
            "id": 80749,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita juga dapat menggunakan ekspresi seperti <code>new - read</code> di antara kurung kurawal untuk menampilkan nilainya.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"new = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"read = \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;\" /><text value=\"{new - read}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\" unread messages&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"37\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"3 unread messages\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>new - read</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Formatted strings",
            "id": 78802,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita bisa menggunakan kurung kurawal untuk menyisipkan nilai sebanyak yang kita mau di dalam f-string. Lihat di sini dengan <code>5</code>, lalu dengan <code>2</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;\" /><text value=\"{\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text value=\" new messages and \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text value=\" friend requests&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"10\" /><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"31\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"5 new messages and 2 friend requests\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>5</code>, diikuti oleh <code>2</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita bisa menggunakan kurung kurawal untuk menyisipkan nilai sebanyak yang kita mau di dalam f-string.</p><p>Isi kurung kurawal agar console menampilkan <code>5 new messages and 2 friend requests</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;\" /><text value=\"{\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text value=\" new messages and \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text value=\" friend requests&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"10\" /><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"6\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"5 new messages and 2 friend requests\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>5</code>, diikuti oleh <code>2</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Formatted strings",
            "id": 82107,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Untuk menggunakan kembali f-string, kita bisa menyimpannya dalam variabel, seperti di sini dengan <code>status</code> dan <code>f\"{new} new messages\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"new = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"status = \" /><text value=\"f&quot;\" /><text value=\"{new}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\" new messages&quot;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(status)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"38\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"5 new messages\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>status</code>, diikuti oleh <code>=</code>, dan terakhir <code>f\"{new} new messages\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Untuk menggunakan kembali f-string, kita bisa menyimpannya dalam variabel, seperti di sini dengan <code>status</code>.</p><p>Simpan f-string dalam <code>status</code> agar mencetaknya menampilkan <code>5 new messages</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"new = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"status = \" /><text value=\"f&quot;\" /><text value=\"{new}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\" new messages&quot;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(status)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"38\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;{new} new messages&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"5 new messages\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>status</code>, diikuti oleh <code>=</code>, dan terakhir <code>f\"{new} new messages\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
